translation.pluginInstallWarning.title	Install {{name}}
translation.pluginInstallWarning.description	Connect Devin to {{name}}. You can uninstall this plugin at any time from settings.
translation.pluginInstallWarning.connectTitle	Connect {{name}}
translation.pluginInstallWarning.connectDescription	You can disconnect {{name}} in settings.
translation.pluginInstallWarning.securityNotice	Security notice
translation.pluginInstallWarning.body	Devin will be allowed to run this plugin's rules, hooks, and skills. Only proceed if you trust this plugin and have verified its source.
translation.pluginInstallWarning.bodyOfficial	Devin will be allowed to run this plugin's rules, hooks, and skills. Only proceed if you trust this plugin.
translation.pluginInstallWarning.bodyMcp	Devin will be allowed to run this plugin's rules, hooks, and skills, including access to external data through its MCP servers. Only proceed if you trust this plugin and have verified its source.
translation.pluginInstallWarning.bodyMcpOfficial	Devin will be allowed to run this plugin's rules, hooks, and skills, including access to external data through its MCP servers. Only proceed if you trust this plugin.
translation.pluginInstallWarning.mcp.title	Enable MCP integration
translation.pluginInstallWarning.mcp.description	Grant Devin access to {{name}}. You can disable this integration at any time from settings.
translation.pluginInstallWarning.mcp.body	You're about to give Devin significant access to {{name}}, allowing it to interact with external data. Only proceed if you trust this integration and have verified its source.
translation.pluginInstallWarning.mcp.sharedOAuth	Enabling this integration will allow all members of your organization to use <strong>the same MCP server connection, sharing a single authentication state for all actions.</strong> <u>We strongly recommend using a service account</u> when Devin prompts you to visit a URL to connect your {{name}} account.
translation.pluginInstallWarning.mcp.sharedOAuthCount	Enabling this integration will allow all {{count}} members of your organization to use <strong>the same MCP server connection, sharing a single authentication state for all actions.</strong> <u>We strongly recommend using a service account</u> when Devin prompts you to visit a URL to connect your {{name}} account.
translation.pluginInstallWarning.mcp.sharedOAuthAccount	Anyone with access to this MCP in Unified mode will use <strong>the same server connection, sharing a single authentication state for all actions.</strong> <u>We strongly recommend using a service account</u> when Devin prompts you to visit a URL to connect your {{name}} account.
translation.pluginInstallWarning.mcp.userOAuthAccount	Each person with access to this MCP authenticates individually with their own personal access token for {{name}}. Other users can still interact with your sessions, so this should not be treated as a security boundary.
translation.pluginInstallWarning.mcp.userOAuth	Each member of your organization will authenticate individually with their own personal access token for {{name}}. Note that other users can still interact with your sessions, so this should not be treated as a security boundary.
