translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.title	Marketplace availability
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.description	Which MCP servers organizations in your enterprise can see and install from the marketplace. Hiding one blocks new installations; organizations that already installed it keep access until they disable or uninstall it there.
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.loadError	Could not load the marketplace servers.
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.search	Search marketplace servers
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.empty	No marketplace servers are available.
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.noMatches	No marketplace servers match your search.
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.hidden	Hidden from the marketplace
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.shown	Shown in the marketplace
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.shownInstalled_one	Shown in the marketplace · installed in {{count}} organization
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.shownInstalled_other	Shown in the marketplace · installed in {{count}} organizations
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.showSwitch	Show {{name}} in the marketplace
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.hideTitle	Hide {{name}} from the marketplace?
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.hideDescription_one	{{count}} organization has an existing installation that will keep working, including in automations. To cut access, disable or uninstall this MCP in each organization.
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.hideDescription_other	{{count}} organizations have existing installations that will keep working, including in automations. To cut access, disable or uninstall this MCP in each organization.
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.cancel	Cancel
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.hideConfirm	Hide from marketplace
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.hideFailed	Could not hide {{name}} from the marketplace
translation.enterpriseMarketplaceAvailability.showFailed	Could not show {{name}} in the marketplace
