translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.connectAfterSave	Save your changes, then connect from this page.
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.connectRedirectHint	You'll be taken to the provider to connect after saving. Use a dedicated bot account on the provider, never a personal account.
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.headerValueConfiguredPlaceholder	Configured — re-enter value to change
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.targetingTitle	Targeting
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.targetingDescription	Which organizations get this server. Resolved at session start — no sync step.
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.targetingPluginAudienceDescription	Which organizations get this server, out of the ones its plugin is available in. Resolved at session start — no sync step.
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.targetingMode	Targeting mode
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.targetingDefaultTitle	Default enabled — all organizations
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.targetingDefaultHint	Every organization in the enterprise receives this server, including organizations created later. Specific organizations can be excluded.
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.targetingSpecificTitle	Specific organizations
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.targetingSpecificHint	Share this server only with organizations you select.
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.targetingDefaultUncheckedHint	Unchecked organizations don't receive this server. New organizations receive it automatically.
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.targetingSpecificUncheckedHint	Unchecked organizations don't receive this server. New organizations aren't added automatically.
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.loadingOrganizations	Loading organizations
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.organizationsLoadError	Unable to load organizations.
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.duplicateInstallationsTitle	Devin will see multiple installations of this server
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.duplicateInstallationsHint	Include details in the name and short description fields so Devin can tell it apart from these installations:
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.couldNotSave	Could not save
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.dangerZone	Danger zone
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.deleteServerHint	Deleting this server removes it from all targeted organizations. Organizations that installed their own copy keep it.
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.deleteServer	Delete server
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.delete	Delete
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.deleteSecretTitle	Delete secret
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.deleteSecretDescription	This deletes the stored value for "{{name}}". Anything referencing ${{name}} will stop resolving until a new value is saved.
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.changeAccess	Change access
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.switchToPersonalTitle	Switch to Personal access?
translation.enterpriseMcpEditor.switchToOrganizationDescription	Existing OAuth tokens will be invalidated. An administrator will need to connect again to restore a shared connection for targeted organizations.
